WEBVTT

00:06:58.309 --> 00:07:01.120
wuxuuna isheegay,"waa qatar,

00:07:01.120 --> 00:07:03.493
kaliya sidii dumar ayaad ugu dhawaaqeysa."

00:07:03.493 --> 00:07:04.955
waxaan dhahay, "Maxay?"

00:07:04.955 --> 00:07:08.877
Wuxuu dhahay, "Haa, dumar miyaad ka baratay?"

00:07:08.877 --> 00:07:10.881
I said, "Haa. Marka?"

00:07:10.881 --> 00:07:13.522
Kadibna wuxuu ii sharaxay farqiga

00:07:13.522 --> 00:07:15.772
u dhaxeeya codadka dumar iyo kan rag

00:07:15.772 --> 00:07:19.574
ineey yihiin kuwa kala duwan misna aan si wacan u bartay,

00:07:19.574 --> 00:07:21.567
laakin asigoo ah cod dumar.

00:07:21.567 --> 00:07:23.790
(Qosol)

00:07:23.790 --> 00:07:31.100
(Sacbis)